  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Mix the mashed soya beans with smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper in a bowl",
    "Layout the ssam wrap sheets on a flat surface",
    "Spread a quarter of the soya bean mixture onto each ssam wrap sheet",
    "Top the soya bean mixture with sliced avocado, red onion, and cucumber on each sheet",
    "Drizzle lemon juice and olive oil over the toppings on each sheet",
    "Fold the bottom half of each ssam wrap sheet over the filling",
    "Fold in the sides and roll up the sheets to form tight cylinders",
    "Place the rolls on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper and bake for 10 minutes"
